OL,3,GNEWSAThousands still without power in
OL,4,Astorm aftermath
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 4,000 homes across Yorkshire
OL,7,Fremain without power after disruption
OL,8,Fcaused by Storm Boelo over the weekend.
OL,10,FAbout 127,000 customers lost power over
OL,11,Fthe weekend across the north of
OL,12,FEngland, but supply had been restored
OL,13,Fto most of them on Sunday night,
OL,14,Faccording to Northern Powergrid.
OL,16,FIn an update at 08:30 GMT on Monday, it
OL,17,Fsaid more than 2,400 households in
OL,18,FNorth Yorkshire were without power,
OL,19,Fwhile 1,900 homes in West Yorkshire
OL,20,Fwere similarly affected. About 350 in
OL,21,FSouth Yorkshire and North Lincolnshire
OL,22,Fwere also without supplies.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
